### 环境切换（默认使用 dev）
GET {{base_url}}/actuator/health

### ========== 基础 CRUD ==========
### 查询所有图书
GET {{base_url}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 查询单本图书（id=1）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 创建图书（POST）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 69.00,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 更新图书（PUT /{id}）
PUT {{base_url}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战（第2版）",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 79.00,
  "stock": 12,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 删除图书（DELETE /{id}）
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/books/4
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 查询：按作者 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/author?name=Craig%20Walls
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 查询：按标题关键字 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/search?keyword=Spring
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 查询：查询结果封装 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/summaries?minPrice=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 查询：价格高于指定值（分页） ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/above-price?minPrice=50&page=1&size=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 查询：按作者和价格区间 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/search-by-author-price?author=Craig%20Walls&min=50&max=100
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 聚合查询：平均价格 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/stats/average-price
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 聚合查询：某分类最高价格 ==========
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/stats/max-price?category=编程
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 更新操作：调整库存（delta 正数增加，负数减少） ==========
PUT {{base_url}}/api/books/1/stock?delta=5
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 更新操作：按分类删除 ==========
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/books/category/运维
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### ========== 排序与分页（多字段排序） ==========
### 分页+排序（默认升序）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/page?page=1&size=5&sortBy=price&direction=desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 按价格降序排序（全量）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/sorted-by-price-desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 按多字段排序（价格降序、标题升序）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/sorted-multi
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456